// 2g + l / 2 holds the high index bits (bits 0..2 for even l, 4..6 for odd) and the delta sign
// (bit 3 / bit 7); the 3-bit scale of slots 0-1 / 2-3 sits at bit 6 (g % 2) / +3 of u16 scale
